{"id":"scrollytelling","title":"Scrollytelling — Product Story","description":"A sticky visual that morphs — colour, shape and caption — while story steps scroll past it. The classic scroll-driven narrative for product launches and campaign pages.","tags":["scrollytelling","story","scroll"],"type":"code","link":null,"updated":"2026-10-11T18:27:25.366Z","docs":{"file":"design.md","raw":"---\ntitle: Scrollytelling — Product Story\ndescription: A sticky visual that morphs — colour, shape and caption — while story steps scroll past it. The classic scroll-driven narrative for product launches and campaign pages.\ntags: [scrollytelling, story, scroll]\norder: 6\n---\n\n# Scrollytelling — Product Story\n\nLeft half is pinned (`position: sticky`); the right half is a tall column of chapters. An IntersectionObserver watches each chapter and drives the visual: number, headline, colour and a morphing blob.\n\n## Tokens\n\n| Token | Value |\n|---|---|\n| Page | `#0f1115` dark stage |\n| Chapter colours | `#6366f1` → `#06b6d4` → `#f59e0b` → `#22c55e` |\n| Step text | 15px system sans on `#171a21` cards |\n| Blob | 260px div with animated `border-radius` |\n\n## Structure\n\n1. The Idea — indigo, dot\n2. The Build — cyan, rounded square\n3. The Launch — amber, star\n4. The Growth — green, full circle\n\n## Files\n\n- `index.html` — self-contained, no dependencies, works offline.\n","body":"\n# Scrollytelling — Product Story\n\nLeft half is pinned (`position: sticky`); the right half is a tall column of chapters. An IntersectionObserver watches each chapter and drives the visual: number, headline, colour and a morphing blob.\n\n## Tokens\n\n| Token | Value |\n|---|---|\n| Page | `#0f1115` dark stage |\n| Chapter colours | `#6366f1` → `#06b6d4` → `#f59e0b` → `#22c55e` |\n| Step text | 15px system sans on `#171a21` cards |\n| Blob | 260px div with animated `border-radius` |\n\n## Structure\n\n1. The Idea — indigo, dot\n2. The Build — cyan, rounded square\n3. The Launch — amber, star\n4. The Growth — green, full circle\n\n## Files\n\n- `index.html` — self-contained, no dependencies, works offline.\n"},"files":[{"path":"index.html","lang":"html","content":"\u003c!DOCTYPE html>\n\u003chtml lang=\"en\">\n\u003chead>\n\u003cmeta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n\u003cmeta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n\u003ctitle>ORBIT — Scrollytelling\u003c/title>\n\u003cstyle>\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }\n  body { font-family: \"Segoe UI\", system-ui, sans-serif; background: #0f1115; color: #e8eaf0; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; }\n  .hero { text-align: center; padding: 90px 24px 60px; }\n  .hero .k { font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.3em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #8a90a5; }\n  .hero h1 { font-size: clamp(30px, 5vw, 52px); letter-spacing: -0.02em; margin-top: 14px; }\n  .hero p { color: #8a90a5; margin-top: 12px; font-size: 15px; }\n  .hero .down { display: inline-block; margin-top: 26px; font-size: 22px; animation: bob 1.6s ease-in-out infinite; }\n  @keyframes bob { 50% { transform: translateY(8px); } }\n\n  .story { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; max-width: 1060px; margin: 0 auto; }\n  .visual { position: sticky; top: 0; height: 100vh; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 26px; }\n  .blob { width: 240px; height: 240px; background: var(--c, #6366f1); transition: background 0.7s ease, border-radius 0.7s ease; display: grid; place-items: center; font-size: 56px; filter: drop-shadow(0 20px 60px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5)); animation: morph 6s ease-in-out infinite; }\n  @keyframes morph {\n    0%, 100% { border-radius: 58% 42% 55% 45% / 52% 56% 44% 48%; }\n    50% { border-radius: 45% 55% 48% 52% / 58% 44% 56% 42%; }\n  }\n  .vcap { text-align: center; }\n  .vnum { font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 0.3em; color: var(--c, #6366f1); font-weight: 700; transition: color 0.7s; }\n  .vtitle { font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -0.01em; margin-top: 6px; }\n\n  .steps { display: grid; gap: 40vh; padding: 40vh 30px 30vh; }\n  .step { background: #171a21; border: 1px solid #232733; border-radius: 18px; padding: 30px; max-width: 400px; opacity: 0.25; transform: translateY(16px); transition: opacity 0.5s ease, transform 0.5s ease, border-color 0.5s; }\n  .step.on { opacity: 1; transform: none; border-color: var(--c); }\n  .step .n { font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.25em; color: var(--c); font-weight: 700; }\n  .step h2 { font-size: 24px; margin: 10px 0; letter-spacing: -0.01em; }\n  .step p { color: #9aa0b4; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.65; }\n  .step .tag { display: inline-block; margin-top: 16px; font-size: 11.5px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--c); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border: 1px solid var(--c); border-radius: 999px; padding: 4px 12px; }\n\n  .end { text-align: center; padding: 120px 24px 140px; }\n  .end h2 { font-size: clamp(26px, 4vw, 40px); letter-spacing: -0.02em; }\n  .end p { color: #8a90a5; margin-top: 10px; }\n  .end .btn { display: inline-block; margin-top: 26px; background: #e8eaf0; color: #0f1115; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; padding: 12px 26px; border-radius: 999px; }\n\n  @media (max-width: 780px) { .story { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .visual { display: none; } .steps { gap: 12vh; padding-top: 8vh; } .step { opacity: 1; transform: none; } }\n\u003c/style>\n\u003c/head>\n\u003cbody>\n  \u003cdiv class=\"hero\">\n    \u003cdiv class=\"k\">A launch story · scroll to read\u003c/div>\n    \u003ch1>From a napkin sketch\u003cbr>to a million users\u003c/h1>\n    \u003cp>Four chapters. One sticky little planet that changes as you go.\u003c/p>\n    \u003cspan class=\"down\">↓\u003c/span>\n  \u003c/div>\n\n  \u003cdiv class=\"story\" id=\"story\">\n    \u003cdiv class=\"visual\" id=\"visual\">\n      \u003cdiv class=\"blob\" id=\"blob\">✳\u003c/div>\n      \u003cdiv class=\"vcap\">\n        \u003cdiv class=\"vnum\" id=\"vnum\">CHAPTER 1\u003c/div>\n        \u003cdiv class=\"vtitle\" id=\"vtitle\">The Idea\u003c/div>\n      \u003c/div>\n    \u003c/div>\n\n    \u003cdiv class=\"steps\">\n      \u003cdiv class=\"step on\" data-c=\"#6366f1\" data-n=\"CHAPTER 1\" data-t=\"The Idea\" data-g=\"✳\">\n        \u003cdiv class=\"n\">CHAPTER 1\u003c/div>\n        \u003ch2>The Idea\u003c/h2>\n        \u003cp>Every product starts as a complaint. Ours was: why does tracking a team's week take eleven tabs and a spreadsheet nobody trusts?\u003c/p>\n        \u003cspan class=\"tag\">2 friends · 1 whiteboard\u003c/span>\n      \u003c/div>\n      \u003cdiv class=\"step\" data-c=\"#06b6d4\" data-n=\"CHAPTER 2\" data-t=\"The Build\" data-g=\"◆\">\n        \u003cdiv class=\"n\">CHAPTER 2\u003c/div>\n        \u003ch2>The Build\u003c/h2>\n        \u003cp>Ninety days of prototypes. We shipped the boring parts first — sync, offline, keyboard shortcuts — and let the polish accumulate like interest.\u003c/p>\n        \u003cspan class=\"tag\">v0.1 → v0.9 in one quarter\u003c/span>\n      \u003c/div>\n      \u003cdiv class=\"step\" data-c=\"#f59e0b\" data-n=\"CHAPTER 3\" data-t=\"The Launch\" data-g=\"▲\">\n        \u003cdiv class=\"n\">CHAPTER 3\u003c/div>\n        \u003ch2>The Launch\u003c/h2>\n        \u003cp>We posted it on a Tuesday morning with a two-sentence demo. By dinner it had 40,000 visitors and one very warm server.\u003c/p>\n        \u003cspan class=\"tag\">#1 product of the day\u003c/span>\n      \u003c/div>\n      \u003cdiv class=\"step\" data-c=\"#22c55e\" data-n=\"CHAPTER 4\" data-t=\"The Growth\" data-g=\"●\">\n        \u003cdiv class=\"n\">CHAPTER 4\u003c/div>\n        \u003ch2>The Growth\u003c/h2>\n        \u003cp>Growth turned out to be the quiet part: answer every email, ship every Tuesday, and never charge for the thing that makes people love you.\u003c/p>\n        \u003cspan class=\"tag\">1,000,000 users and counting\u003c/span>\n      \u003c/div>\n    \u003c/div>\n  \u003c/div>\n\n  \u003cdiv class=\"end\">\n    \u003ch2>Your chapter goes here.\u003c/h2>\n    \u003cp>Swap the copy, keep the machinery — four steps, one sticky visual, endless stories.\u003c/p>\n    \u003ca class=\"btn\" href=\"#\">Start your story\u003c/a>\n  \u003c/div>\n\n  \u003cscript>\n    const steps = document.querySelectorAll('.step');\n    const blob = document.getElementById('blob');\n    const vnum = document.getElementById('vnum');\n    const vtitle = document.getElementById('vtitle');\n    const visual = document.getElementById('visual');\n    const io = new IntersectionObserver(es => {\n      es.forEach(e => {\n        if (!e.isIntersecting) return;\n        steps.forEach(s => s.classList.remove('on'));\n        e.target.classList.add('on');\n        const c = e.target.dataset.c;\n        visual.style.setProperty('--c', c);\n        blob.textContent = e.target.dataset.g;\n        vnum.textContent = e.target.dataset.n;\n        vtitle.textContent = e.target.dataset.t;\n      });\n    }, { rootMargin: '-40% 0px -40% 0px' });\n    steps.forEach(s => io.observe(s));\n  \u003c/script>\n\u003c/body>\n\u003c/html>\n"}],"preview":{"file":"index.html","html":"\u003c!DOCTYPE html>\n\u003chtml lang=\"en\">\n\u003chead>\u003cscript>(function(){try{window.localStorage.getItem(\"__probe__\")}catch(e){var s={};var o={getItem:function(k){return k in s?s[k]:null},setItem:function(k,v){s[k]=String(v)},removeItem:function(k){delete s[k]},clear:function(){s={}},key:function(i){return Object.keys(s)[i]||null}};Object.defineProperty(o,\"length\",{get:function(){return Object.keys(s).length},configurable:true});try{Object.defineProperty(window,\"localStorage\",{value:o,configurable:true})}catch(e2){}}})();\u003c/script>\n\u003cmeta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n\u003cmeta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n\u003ctitle>ORBIT — Scrollytelling\u003c/title>\n\u003cstyle>\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }\n  body { font-family: \"Segoe UI\", system-ui, sans-serif; background: #0